<section id="cli" class="border-t border-line px-4 py-16 sm:px-8">
  <div id="start" class="mx-auto flex max-w-[1200px] flex-wrap items-start gap-12">
    <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-[1_1_360px] flex-col gap-3">
      <span class="eyebrow">Get started</span>
      <h2 class="text-h1">Install, check, format</h2>
      <p class="text-ink-soft">The appling command checks your models and writes them in canonical form. Point it at a folder; files that reference each other load as one workspace.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 pt-2">
        <p class="text-sm leading-[22px] text-ink-muted"><code class="rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface-elevated px-1.5 font-mono text-xs text-ink">check</code> validates every .appling file and exits with 1 when it finds errors.</p>
        <p class="text-sm leading-[22px] text-ink-muted"><code class="rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface-elevated px-1.5 font-mono text-xs text-ink">fmt</code> rewrites files into canonical form. A second run changes nothing.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="min-w-0 flex-[1_1_520px] overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface-raised">
      <div class="border-b border-line px-4 py-2 font-mono text-xs leading-5 text-ink-muted">terminal</div>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 overflow-x-auto p-6 text-code">
        <span class="text-ink-muted"># add the CLI to your project</span>
        <span class="type whitespace-nowrap" style="animation-delay: .2s"><span class="text-leaf">$ </span>npm i -D @appling/cli</span>
        <span class="text-ink-muted"># validate every model</span>
        <span class="type whitespace-nowrap" style="animation-delay: 1.4s"><span class="text-leaf">$ </span>npx @appling/cli check models</span>
        <span class="text-ink-muted"># write canonical form</span>
        <span class="whitespace-nowrap"><span class="type inline-block" style="animation-delay: 2.6s"><span class="text-leaf">$ </span>npx @appling/cli fmt models</span><span class="cursor"></span></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
